	measure MTDVol_LastDayPrevMonth_TotalSubSet = ```
			
			CALCULATE(
			    SUM(factdailysalesreport[MTD_Volume]),
			    DimSubSet[Channel] IN {"Atoz", "SOI", "Oasis", "Viva", "Trusted"},
			    DimDate[Date] = EOMONTH(TODAY(), -1)
			)
			
			
			```
		lineageTag: 619f47aa-0ae5-429c-925b-1a34b1da52a6

		annotation PBI_FormatHint = {"isGeneralNumber":true}

